{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"Seraxa takes the Sea Farer's Foil that Meorys dropped and handles it carefully, with familiarity. \"I, uh, I gave this to you -- well, you technically bought it from me -- but it's been with me so long it's hard to imagine it as 'not mine' anymore.\"\n\n\"But it's yours now, alright? So you gotta get up, and you gotta make sure you use it. At least as long as I have, which is like a hundred years. You'll live that long. You're a *fucking* phantom, Meorys.\"\n\nAnd then Seraxa takes her silver pilot wings and places them between Luard's lifeless hands. \"Luard, buddy, I know you have some wings of your own, but... you're our pilot, okay? We haven't even made our ship yet.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T03:42:09.290000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T04:04:19.395000Z","id":"865075742283268138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
